        "kind": "documented-adapted",
        "note": "WP-123: the shape of \"List all merge request discussion items\" — a discussion's id, individual_note and notes, each note's id, type, body, author, created_at, updated_at, system, noteable_*, resolvable and resolved — re-read on 2026-10-02. Adapted: three discussions of this corpus's own on merge request 33, each note at its own created_at so the poll-only binding's review-note read has instants to compare — one person's DiscussionNote, one provider system note, and one note the platform posts (opening with its <!-- agentic:… --> marker, as conflictWarningBody writes it). The page's example shows no system note: its shape here (individual_note true, type null, system true, resolvable false) is the one discussions.json already carries, not a recording."
